[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0087","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1390","title":"GeneWeb 4.09之前版本守护进程路径处理不当导致任意文件读取漏洞","description":"GeneWeb 4.09 之前版本的守护进程（daemon）在处理请求路径时存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含特殊字符（如 \"../\"）的恶意 URL，绕过路径限制读取服务器上任意文件，导致系统敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，影响范围涵盖 GeneWeb 4.09 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1390"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"立即将 GeneWeb 升级至 4.09 或更高版本（该版本于 2002 年 12 月 30 日发布，修复了路径处理不当导致的任意文件读取漏洞）。Debian 用户应参考 DSA-223 安全公告安装对应更新。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 GeneWeb 守护进程（gwd）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并避免将 GeneWeb 暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cristal.inria.fr/~ddr/GeneWeb/en/version/4.09.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-223","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6549","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1390","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/375cadc04f272885b5b806a51aaff0f00770b97f/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1390.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0087.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0372","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1379","title":"OpenLDAP libldap .ldaprc 文件读取远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 2.2.0 及更早版本中的 libldap 库在解析 .ldaprc 配置文件时存在缺陷，当应用程序以提升权限运行时，远程或本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的 .ldaprc 文件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 OpenLDAP 2 系列多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1379"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenLDAP 至 2.2.0 以上版本（如 2.3.x 或更高），该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。Debian 用户请安装 DSA-227 对应安全更新包。临时缓解措施：确保 .ldaprc 文件权限为 600 且属主为可信用户，避免以 root 等高权限运行调用 libldap 的应用程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-227","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:006","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_047_openldap2.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1379","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2002/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1379.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1379.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1379.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0370","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1378","title":"OpenLDAP OpenLDAP 2 多缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenLDAP 2（OpenLDAP2）2.2.0 及更早版本存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过以下五种方式触发该漏洞：向 slurpd 传递超长的 -t 或 -r 参数；提交恶意构造的 ldapfilter.conf 文件，getfilter 函数未能正确处理导致溢出；提交恶意 ldaptemplates.conf 文件导致 libldap 发生溢出；构造特定的访问控制列表触发 slapd 溢出；或利用日志记录拒绝复制请求时生成超长文件名。成功利用该漏洞可导致远程代码执行，CVSS 评分 7.5，影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1378"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12Z","remediation":"升级 OpenLDAP 至 2.2.1 或更高版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Debian 用户运行 apt-get install slapd 更新至 DSA-227 修复版本；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003-040 提供的更新包；SuSE Linux 用户安装 advisory 2002-47-0047 提供的修补包。如无法立即升级，可在 slapd 配置中限制访问控制列表（ACL）的复杂规则，并避免使用 slurpd 的 -t/-r 长参数传递不可信输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000556","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-043.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-227","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/gentoo_advisory-2704.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:006","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_047_openldap2.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-040.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4827","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6328","http://www.turbolinux.com/security/TLSA-2003-5.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10800","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1378","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2002/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1378.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1378.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1378.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0086","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1389","title":"typespeed 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"typespeed 0.4.2 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向程序提交超长输入触发栈溢出，导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 typespeed 全系列低版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可获取与目标进程相同的用户权限，进而执行任意代码或控制系统。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1389"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 typespeed 至 0.4.3 或更高版本（已修复该缓冲区溢出），Debian 用户可通过 apt 安装 DSA-217 安全更新包。若无法升级，请卸载 typespeed 或移除其 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/games/typespeed）以阻断本地提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-217","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6485","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10936","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1389","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/939814c958d14a0bcaf2639e41afe118cdb5f74c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcgq-fw72-gpjp/GHSA-xcgq-fw72-gpjp.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-217.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1389.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2008/deb_217_1.nasl","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0085","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1388","title":"MHonArc HTML 邮件归档跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MHonArc 邮件归档工具 2.5.13 及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向邮件列表发送包含恶意 HTML 代码的邮件，当 MHonArc 处理并生成 Web 归档页面时，未对邮件内容中的 HTML 标签进行充分过滤，导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，影响所有使用 MHonArc 生成邮件归档的网站。升级至 2.5.14 版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1388"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"升级 MHonArc 至 2.6.18 或更高版本（官网最新为 2.6.19），该版本修复了 HTML 过滤器的 XSS 漏洞。Debian 用户应升级至 2.5.2-1.3 或更新版本。如无法立即升级，可在 MHonArc 配置中启用 `TEXTAREAS` 或 `MIMEFILTERS` 过滤 HTML 邮件内容，将不可信来源的 HTML 邮件转为纯文本显示作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-221","http://www.mhonarc.org/archive/cgi-bin/mesg.cgi?a=mhonarc-users&i=200212220120.gBM1K8502180%40mcguire.earlhood.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6479","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10950","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1388.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1388","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1388.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1388.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0f14531dae9947fef349fa696ac83d6fc56f601e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jj32-64ww-6673/GHSA-jj32-64ww-6673.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-221.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2003/dsa-221.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7176a127-21f1-4346-bcca-d2e509f0274f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0084","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1384","title":"Xpdf pdftops 整数溢出本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Xpdf 2.01 及更早版本、xpdf-i 以及 CUPS 1.1.18 之前版本中的 pdftops 组件存在整数溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造包含大量元素的 ColorSpace 条目的特制 PDF 文件触发该溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响范围包括 Xpdf 和 CUPS 打印系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1384"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13Z","remediation":"升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 及以上版本，升级 Xpdf 至 2.02 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 pdftops 工具的访问权限，或移除 cups-pdf 组件以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104152282309980&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-222","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-226","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-232","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.23.02.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:001","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:002","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-307.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-037.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-216.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6475","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10937","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1384","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2002/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1384.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1384","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1384.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1384.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0436","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2215","title":"PHP IMAP imap_header 函数拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PHP 4.3.0 之前版本的 IMAP 扩展中存在拒绝服务漏洞，该漏洞位于 imap_header 函数处理邮件头部的过程中。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送一封包含大量 \"To\" 收件人地址的恶意电子邮件，触发 rfc822_write_address 函数在处理超长地址列表时发生内部错误，导致 PHP 进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送特制邮件即可触发，影响 PHP 4.3.0 之前所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2215"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:51Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.3.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 imap_header 函数在处理大量收件人地址时触发 rfc822_write_address 错误导致拒绝服务的问题。如无法立即升级，可在邮件服务器端限制单封邮件的收件人数量（如每封不超过 100 个 To 地址），并禁用 PHP IMAP 扩展中不必要的邮件解析功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=19280","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=175040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2215","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2002/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2215.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2215.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2215.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0434","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2214","title":"PHP IMAP php_if_imap_mime_header_decode 函数拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PHP 4.2.2 之前版本的 IMAP 功能中存在 php_if_imap_mime_header_decode 函数缓冲区处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 \"To\" 头的特制电子邮件，触发该函数在处理邮件头时发生内存访问越界，导致 PHP 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 PHP 4.2.0 和 4.2.1 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2214"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:51Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 IMAP 扩展中 php_if_imap_mime_header_decode 函数处理超长邮件头时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 IMAP 扩展（在 extension=imap 前添加分号注释掉），或通过防火墙限制对邮件服务的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=15595","http://secunia.com/advisories/21202","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0567.html","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=175040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2214","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e272b519ec8a57a1db338df26d96406/2002/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2214.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-22xx/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2214.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2214.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0432","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2210","title":"OpenOffice 1.0.1 安装临时文件符号链接本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenOffice 1.0.1 安装过程中存在不安全的临时文件处理漏洞，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击利用 `USERNAME_autoresponse.conf` 临时文件，在目标系统上覆盖任意文件并可能提升权限。攻击条件为攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较高（需预测临时文件名及时间窗口），但一旦成功可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。建议升级至更高版本或确保临时目录权限配置正确。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2210"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:51Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenOffice 1.1.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了安装过程中临时文件的不安全创建问题。如无法升级，安装前确保临时目录（/tmp）无其他用户写入的恶意符号链接，或以非特权用户身份执行安装。当前建议迁移至 Apache OpenOffice 4.x 或 LibreOffice 系列以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0161.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10346.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5950","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2210","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-22xx/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e272b519ec8a57a1db338df26d96406/2002/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2210.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2210.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2210.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0432.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0432.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0432.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0430","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0430.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2204","title":"RPM Package Manager 签名验证用户反馈不足漏洞","description":"RPM 包管理器 4.0.4 版本的默认 --checksig 签名验证机制存在安全缺陷，仅验证软件包签名的有效性而未向用户显示签名者身份信息，导致远程攻击者可通过替换或伪造恶意软件包的签名，使其看似来自受信任的合法来源。用户在执行安装时无法区分包的真实来源，从而可能被诱导安装包含后门或恶意代码的软件包。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程实施该攻击，影响使用 RPM 包管理器的 Linux 发行版系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2204"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:50Z","remediation":"升级 RPM 至 4.1 或更高版本，新版默认会在签名验证时显示签名者信息。如无法升级，使用 `rpm -K --nogpg` 仅检查完整性，或通过 `rpm -Kvv <package>` 手动查看签名详情；同时建议导入并信任官方 GPG 公钥后使用 `rpm -K <package>` 验证签名归属。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.netsys.com/pipermail/full-disclosure/2002-August/001167.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10011.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5594","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2204","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e272b519ec8a57a1db338df26d96406/2002/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2204.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-22xx/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2204.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2204.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0430.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0429","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0429.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2196","title":"Samba 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Samba 2.2.5 之前版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于 enum_csc_policy 数据结构未正确终止，远程攻击者可通过向 Samba 服务发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.2.5 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 Samba 2.2.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2196"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:49Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.2.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 enum_csc_policy 数据结构未正确终止导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 smb.conf 中禁用相关 RPC 服务或通过防火墙限制 SMB 端口（139/TCP、445/TCP）的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.samba.org/archive/samba-technical/2002-June/022075.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2002-209.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10010.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5587","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2196","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2002/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2196.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2196.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-21xx/CVE-2002-2196.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0427","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0427.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2185","title":"Linux IGMP 协议本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IGMP（Internet组管理协议）存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向目标的以太网地址而非组播组地址发送IGMP成员报告报文，导致目标系统停止向路由器发送成员报告，从而将目标从组播组中断开连接。该漏洞影响Mandrake Linux等系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用方式简单，可造成目标网络组播通信中断，CVSS评分4.9，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2185"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:48Z","remediation":"建议更新 Linux 内核至 Red Hat 提供的 RHSA-2006-0101/RHSA-2006-0140/RHSA-2006-0190/RHSA-2006-0191 等安全公告中修复该漏洞的内核版本，或安装 SGI 补丁 20020901-01-A。如无法立即更新，可在不需要组播功能的系统上禁用 IGMP 协议（如通过 iptables 过滤 IGMP 报文），并严格限制本地用户访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/276968","http://secunia.com/advisories/18510","http://secunia.com/advisories/18562","http://secunia.com/advisories/18684","http://www.cs.ucsb.edu/~krishna/igmp_dos/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0101.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0140.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0190.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2006-0191.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/427980/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/427981/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/428028/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/428058/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5020","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9436","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10736","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-2185.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-2264.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-2185.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2185","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-2185.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2185.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-2185.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2185.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2002/CVE-2002-2185.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0427.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0426","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0426.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2103","title":"Apache HTTP Server 反向查询日志主机名欺骗漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.24 之前版本在记录日志时，即使双反向 DNS 查询失败，仍会记录 IP 地址反向查询返回的伪造主机名，导致日志条目中记录的主机名不可信。远程攻击者可通过构造虚假的 DNS PTR 记录，使 Apache 日志中显示伪造的主机名，从而隐藏攻击的真实来源 IP，给日志审计和溯源分析带来困难。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2103"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:39Z","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.24 或更高版本，该版本修复了反向 DNS 查询验证逻辑，在双反向解析失败时记录原始 IP 而非伪造主机名。如无法升级，可在 httpd.conf 中将 HostnameLookups 设为 Off 并启用 mod_log_forensic 记录真实 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_1.3","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8629.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4358","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2103","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2002/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2103.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2103.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-21xx/CVE-2002-2103.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0426.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0425","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0425.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2061","title":"Netscape Mozilla PNG 图片处理堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape 6.2.3 及 Mozilla 1.0 及更早版本中存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向用户发送特制的 PNG 图像（包含超大宽度和高度值以及 8 位或 16 位 Alpha 通道）触发该漏洞，导致目标浏览器崩溃，甚至可能执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证且复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响用户应升级至不受影响的版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2061"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:34Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla 至 1.0.1 及以上版本，或升级 Netscape 至 6.2.4 及以上版本。由于上述浏览器均已停止维护，建议立即更换为 Firefox、Chrome 等现代浏览器，并保持自动更新开启。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 PNG 图片渲染（通过 about:config 设置 image.png.enabled 为 false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=157202","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9287.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:074","http://www.mozilla.org/releases/mozilla1.0.1/security-fixes-1.0.1.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2061","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2002/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2061.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-20xx/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2061.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2061.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0425.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0423","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0423.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2043","title":"Cyrus SASL LDAP和MySQL认证SQL注入漏洞","description":"Cyrus SASL 1.5.24 及 1.5.27 版本中的 LDAP 和 MySQL 认证补丁存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的密码参数，触发 SQL 注入攻击，从而执行任意 SQL 命令并以任意 POP 邮件用户身份登录系统。该漏洞影响 Cyrus SASL 的 LDAP/MySQL 认证模块，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，可导致敏感信息泄露和权限绕过。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2043"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:32Z","remediation":"升级 Cyrus SASL 至 2.1.x 或更高版本（1.5.x 系列已停止维护），该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，移除第三方 LDAP/MySQL 认证补丁，改用 Cyrus SASL 内置的 sasldb 或 PAM 认证机制。若必须使用 LDAP/MySQL 认证，需对用户输入的密码参数进行严格的参数化查询和输入过滤，防止 SQL 注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0020.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8748.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4409","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2043","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30161b4638c37443322916a4d97a62c41686781e/2002/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-20xx/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2043.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-2043.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2043.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0423.toml"}]